    "regime_notes": "Strong in 2020-2025 (IC 0.050941, ICIR 0.168912), weak/negative in 2026-2030 (2026-2028 IC 0.001173; 2029-2030 IC -0.023296), and recovering in 2031 (IC 0.021786). Interpret recent regime dependence conservatively."
